		scenarioDetails={megapolisPossible=false,blitzPossible="On Only",ruleStates={apocalypse=28},playerDetails="{en}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ru}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-tw}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-cn}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ko}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{es}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{fr}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{pt-br}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{de}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo",countryRules="{en}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){ru}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){zh-tw}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){zh-cn}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){ko}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){es}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){fr}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){pt-br}(Country Tile 1 in the Center){de}(Country Tile 1 in the Center)",scenarioPurpose="{en}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{ru}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{zh-tw}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{zh-cn}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{ko}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{es}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{fr}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{pt-br}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>{de}Stop the Four Horsemen from reaching the magical glade at the center of the map and performing their ritual.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen are performing some kind of terrible ritual, culminating at a site of magical power. You must stop any of them from finishing the ritual.</i></color>",scenarioEnd="{en}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ru}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-tw}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-cn}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ko}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{es}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{fr}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{pt-br}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{de}When all Horsemen are defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately."}},
