		scenarioDetails={megapolisPossible=false,blitzPossible="On Only",ruleStates={apocalypse=31},playerDetails="{en}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ru}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-tw}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-cn}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ko}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{es}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{fr}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{pt-br}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{de}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo",coreRules="{en}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){ru}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){zh-tw}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){zh-cn}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){ko}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){es}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){fr}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){pt-br}(Core non-city tile 3 is included){de}(Core non-city tile 3 is included)",scenarioPurpose="{en}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{ru}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{zh-tw}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{zh-cn}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{ko}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{es}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{fr}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{pt-br}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>{de}Reach the Apocalypse Dragon’s lair as it attacks you from the air, then defeat it when it lands to protect its sanctuary.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Apocalypse Dragon has started its destructive purging of the countryside, swooping down on unsuspecting villagers and experienced troops alike. You must reach its lair to force it to confront you on the ground and then defeat it in its sanctuary.</i></color>",scenarioEnd="{en}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ru}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-tw}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-cn}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ko}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{es}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{fr}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{pt-br}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{de}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately."}},
