		scenarioDetails={megapolisPossible=false,blitzPossible="Off Only",ruleStates={apocalypse=34},playerDetails="{en}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ru}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-tw}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-cn}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ko}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{es}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{fr}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{pt-br}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{de}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo",cityRules="{en}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){ru}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){zh-tw}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){zh-cn}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){ko}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){es}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){fr}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){pt-br}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon){de}(first City is friendly; second City is destroyed by the Dragon)",scenarioPurpose="{en}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{ru}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{zh-tw}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{zh-cn}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{ko}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{es}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{fr}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{pt-br}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>{de}Stop the Four Horsemen and defeat the Apocalypse Dragon.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>The Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse are on the move, spreading death and destruction, and in doing so, empowering the newly reborn Apocalypse Dragon. You must stop the Horsemen and then defeat the Dragon before it is too late.</i></color>",scenarioEnd="{en}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ru}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-tw}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{zh-cn}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{ko}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{es}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{fr}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{pt-br}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately.{de}When the Apocalypse Dragon is defeated, all players (except the Dummy player) have one last turn. If the Round ends during this, the game ends immediately."}},
