		scenarioDetails={megapolisPossible=true,blitzPossible="On Only",ruleStates={apocalypse=40},playerDetails="{en}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ru}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-tw}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{zh-cn}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{ko}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{es}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{fr}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{pt-br}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo{de}1 to 4 - Cooperative, Competitive and Solo",scenarioPurpose="{en}Adventure into lands fractured by The Breaking. Use Quests and the Greatest Quester variant, explore freely, and take advantage of folding corridors to teleport across the land.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>These lands were particularly badly affected by The Breaking. They fractured, but also folded in on themselves. While confusing for some, those with the powers of a Mage Knight can understand the patterns, take advantage of the folding, and teleport to other parts of the land.</i></color>{ru}Adventure into lands fractured by The Breaking. Use Quests and the Greatest Quester variant, explore freely, and take advantage of folding corridors to teleport across the land.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>These lands were particularly badly affected by The Breaking. They fractured, but also folded in on themselves. While confusing for some, those with the powers of a Mage Knight can understand the patterns, take advantage of the folding, and teleport to other parts of the land.</i></color>{zh-tw}Adventure into lands fractured by The Breaking. Use Quests and the Greatest Quester variant, explore freely, and take advantage of folding corridors to teleport across the land.<size=6>\n\n</size><color=#8c5e35><i>These lands were particularly badly affected by The Breaking. They fractured, but also folded in on themselves. While confusing for some, those with the powers of a Mage Knight can understand the patterns, take adva